,"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.7.stable.official [5b4e0cb0f]\n- Reproducible in v4.5.1.stable.official [f62fdbde1]\n- Reproducible in v4.5.stable.official [876b29033]\n- Feature doesn't exist in v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\n- Not reproducible in v4.2.stable.official [46dc27791] (Feature Exists)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9227) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600H with Radeon Graphics (12 threads) - 31.34 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe `EditorHelp` page of custom user scripts without a `class_name` shows up in the Script Editor \"tab\"/\"file\" selector as `%s Class Reference` (with %s being the filename) in some languages (but not English), which is a problem, since some languages translate it so that the `Class Reference` is before the path, so on the default settings you can't see what the filename is.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/98b196ee-217f-4b53-bef9-784a04718f7e\n\nIf this isn't a bug, at least make it consistent across diffrent languages.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the MRP\n2. Open the Script editor (\"Script\" tab in the 2D, 3D, Asset Store)\n3. Click \"Search Help\"\n4. Type \"new_script.gd\"\n5. Click \"Open\"\n6. Change the editor language (in Editor Settings) to something else than English (like Polish, Greek, Czech, Indonesian)\n7. Notice the tab now contains \"Class Reference\" translated to that language\n<img width=\"282\" height=\"182\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5071c45c-e8a6-425d-8105-62d892914923\" />\n\nNOTE: It only works for some languages, as I mentioned. Examples that *don't* work: English, Dutch, German, Spanish\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29751524/mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121048/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121048/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}